sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Borrower as Borrower via controller
    participant SG as :SessionGuard
    participant RG as :RolesGuard
    participant Booking as :RoomBookingService
    participant Timetable as :TimetableService
    participant DB as :PrismaService
    participant Time as :Clock
    participant History as :HistoryService
    Borrower->>SG: canActivate(cookie)
    SG-->>Borrower: Principal or 401
    Borrower->>RG: authorize(principal,Borrower)
    RG-->>Borrower: Allow or 403
    Note over Borrower,Booking: Proceed only if both guards allow, requester comes from session.
    Borrower->>Booking: submit(input,actor)
    Booking->>Timetable: deriveInterval(bookingDate,firstPeriod,lastPeriod)
    Timetable-->>Booking: Interval or invalid selection
    Booking->>Time: now()
    Time-->>Booking: serverNow
    alt Invalid period selection or input
        Booking-->>Borrower: Field error, retain entered values, no request
    else Valid period/input format
        Booking->>DB: $transaction(validateRoomAndInsertPending)
        Note over Booking,DB: Recheck current account/role, room Visible+In service and capacity.<br/>Start > now, purpose nonblank, integer headcount 1..capacity.<br/>Reject Approved overlap over full derived interval including intervening break.<br/>Pending requests do not block each other.<br/>Approval uses ADR-004 GiST exclusion and returns 409 on overlap.
        alt Room unavailable, overlap, stale input or lost authority
            DB-->>Booking: Rollback
            Booking-->>Borrower: Field/conflict error, preserve input
        else Eligible new request
            Booking->>History: append(submissionEvent,tx)
            History-->>Booking: Stored or failure
            Note over Booking,DB: Save Pending with session borrowerId, no room reservation.<br/>Commit Pending and audit together.
            alt Persistence/history/commit fails
                DB-->>Booking: Rollback
                Booking-->>Borrower: Failure, no partial request
            else Commit succeeds
                DB-->>Booking: Booking identifier and Pending
                Booking-->>Borrower: Submitted successfully, awaiting decision
            end
        end
    end
